    q("The first military coup in Nigeria took place on", ["15 January 1966", "29 July 1966", "13 February 1976", "31 December 1983"], 0, "15 January 1966, led by Major Kaduna Nzeogwu and other officers. July 1966 is the counter-coup, February 1976 the Dimka attempt and December 1983 the Buhari coup."),
