    q("The July 1966 counter-coup brought to power", ["Yakubu Gowon", "Murtala Muhammed", "Johnson Aguiyi-Ironsi", "Sani Abacha"], 0, "Gowon became head of state after the counter-coup of 29 July 1966, which also killed Ironsi."),
