    q("Murtala Muhammed was assassinated on", ["13 February 1976", "29 July 1975", "15 January 1966", "1 October 1979"], 0, "13 February 1976, in the failed Dimka coup. 29 July 1975 is the coup that brought him to power, and 1979 the handover."),
