    q("An ouster clause in a military decree", ["removes the jurisdiction of the courts over the decree", "grants amnesty to soldiers", "creates a new state", "transfers power to civilians"], 0, "The clause ousts the court's jurisdiction, so the decree cannot be challenged. It is the single most examined instrument of military rule."),
