    q("Military rule in Nigeria is often said to have centralised the country because", ["the regions were abolished and replaced by weaker states", "the states were given more power", "local government was abolished", "the army withdrew from politics"], 0, "Abolishing the regions removed the only units with the standing to challenge the centre, and the new states were smaller and more dependent."),
