    q("The balance sheet of military rule includes which of the following failures?", ["Human-rights abuses and the erosion of the courts", "The creation of states", "The building of the FCT", "The founding of ECOWAS"], 0, "Ouster clauses, detention without trial and the Abacha record are the standard debits. The other three are the credits."),
    q("A counter-coup is", ["a coup that removes the government installed by an earlier coup", "a failed coup", "a civilian revolution", "a military parade"], 0, "July 1966 is the classic case: it removed the government that January 1966 had installed. A failed coup is an attempted coup, not a counter-coup."),
