    q("The military government of Gowon is associated with", ["the civil war and the creation of twelve states", "the annulment of June 12", "the creation of the FCT", "the 1979 handover"], 0, "Gowon ruled through the civil war and created twelve states in 1967. The annulment and the FCT belong to later governments."),
