    q("The military government that created thirty-six states in 1996 was led by", ["Sani Abacha", "Ibrahim Babangida", "Abdulsalami Abubakar", "Muhammadu Buhari"], 0, "Abacha created six states in 1996, bringing the total to thirty-six. Babangida created nine in 1991 and Abubakar handed over in 1999."),
